{"unit_id":"SnowfallC__dsh-mobile-web-remote#feature-feature-1","repo":"SnowfallC/dsh-mobile-web-remote","commit":"bfd3e169b1f009cc7e7974896253a8fb83982dd6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile Web Remote 的功能「扫码配对手机」：桌面端显示包含临时访问地址和一次性令牌的二维码；手机浏览器提交令牌后建立会话并进入 DSH 页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:23-32","src/mobile-bridge.js:64-81"]}
{"unit_id":"SnowfallC__dsh-mobile-web-remote#feature-feature-2","repo":"SnowfallC/dsh-mobile-web-remote","commit":"bfd3e169b1f009cc7e7974896253a8fb83982dd6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile Web Remote 的功能「转发 DSH 页面与连接」：本机桥接服务把已授权的 HTTP 请求和 WebSocket 连接转发到 DSH Web profile，并在首页注入移动端界面限制。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/mobile-bridge.js:38-50","src/mobile-bridge.js:89-108"]}
{"unit_id":"SnowfallC__dsh-mobile-web-remote#feature-feature-3","repo":"SnowfallC/dsh-mobile-web-remote","commit":"bfd3e169b1f009cc7e7974896253a8fb83982dd6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile Web Remote 的功能「管理手机连接」：本地管理页显示配对状态和二维码，用户可以撤销当前链接或重新生成配对信息；插件关闭时会回收桥接和隧道进程。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:53-76","src/pages.js:86-105"]}
{"unit_id":"SnowfallC__dsh-mobile-web-remote#caveat-caveat-1","repo":"SnowfallC/dsh-mobile-web-remote","commit":"bfd3e169b1f009cc7e7974896253a8fb83982dd6","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile Web Remote 使用 Cloudflare Quick Tunnel 提供临时手机访问地址；手机与桌面间的远程流量会经过该隧道。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/cloudflared.js:3-14"]}
